--- body ---
## Context

Five test files use hardcoded relative paths like `FIXTURES="tests/fixtures/close"`.
They work only when run from repo root. Using `mktemp -d` makes them cwd-independent.

## Actions

- Replace `FIXTURES="tests/fixtures/<name>"` with `FIXTURES=$(mktemp -d)` in
  test_close.sh, test_log.sh, test_archive.sh, test_migrate.sh, test_ready.sh
- Remove redundant `mkdir -p "$FIXTURES"` (mktemp already creates the dir)
- Fix test_ready.sh trap to rm the whole mktemp dir

## Exit criteria

- All five test suites pass: `make test-close test-log test-archive test-migrate test-ready`
- No hardcoded `tests/fixtures/` path remains in those files
